TRANSCRIPTION_PROMPT = """You are transcribing an audio recording of a tabletop D&D session. Produce a timestamped transcript. Use [HH:MM:SS] timestamps roughly every 30 seconds or whenever the speaker changes. Label speakers as Speaker A, Speaker B, etc., and try to remain consistent. If a character name is clearly spoken by a speaker (e.g., someone says "Thorne attacks the goblin"), note the character name inline like `Speaker A (as Thorne)`. If you can identify the DM (the person narrating the world, describing scenes, and refereeing rules), label them as `Speaker X (DM)`. Ignore background music, dice sounds, and ambient noise unless they are narratively relevant (e.g. a dramatic pause). Output the transcript only — no preamble."""
